1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:00,880
Watch this.

2
00:00:00,790 --> 00:00:01,780
One sentence:

3
00:00:01,740 --> 00:00:03,130
find me three internships,

4
00:00:02,980 --> 00:00:03,720
and save them

5
00:00:03,570 --> 00:00:04,260
in a sheet.

6
00:00:04,580 --> 00:00:05,580
The AI opens

7
00:00:05,430 --> 00:00:06,860
a browser, searches,

8
00:00:06,760 --> 00:00:07,880
reads the results,

9
00:00:07,730 --> 00:00:08,810
and fills the sheet.

10
00:00:08,980 --> 00:00:10,000
By itself.

11
00:00:09,850 --> 00:00:11,370
That's not a chatbot.

12
00:00:11,220 --> 00:00:12,240
That's an agent.

13
00:00:12,420 --> 00:00:13,360
And right now,

14
00:00:13,210 --> 00:00:14,500
every AI company

15
00:00:14,350 --> 00:00:15,230
is launching one.

16
00:00:15,570 --> 00:00:16,940
OpenAI just gave its

17
00:00:16,790 --> 00:00:17,800
agents their own

18
00:00:17,650 --> 00:00:18,950
computer and browser.

19
00:00:19,310 --> 00:00:20,100
So what is

20
00:00:19,950 --> 00:00:20,640
an agent?

21
00:00:20,880 --> 00:00:22,460
AI that uses tools,

22
00:00:22,310 --> 00:00:23,070
in a loop,

23
00:00:22,920 --> 00:00:23,680
until a goal

24
00:00:23,530 --> 00:00:24,140
is done.

25
00:00:24,550 --> 00:00:25,900
Here's what really happened.

26
00:00:25,930 --> 00:00:26,660
It thought,

27
00:00:26,510 --> 00:00:27,550
I need to search.

28
00:00:27,570 --> 00:00:28,330
It acted,

29
00:00:28,180 --> 00:00:29,330
and opened the browser.

30
00:00:29,620 --> 00:00:30,280
It looked at

31
00:00:30,130 --> 00:00:30,910
the results.

32
00:00:30,760 --> 00:00:32,110
Then it decided

33
00:00:31,960 --> 00:00:32,800
the next step.

34
00:00:32,930 --> 00:00:33,890
Again and again,

35
00:00:33,740 --> 00:00:34,600
until the sheet

36
00:00:34,450 --> 00:00:34,980
was full.

37
00:00:35,400 --> 00:00:37,580
Think, act, observe, repeat.

38
00:00:37,750 --> 00:00:38,760
Comment AGENT,

39
00:00:38,610 --> 00:00:39,560
and I'll DM you

40
00:00:39,410 --> 00:00:40,650
three agent setups you

41
00:00:40,500 --> 00:00:41,580
can try this week.

